## 7. `.env.example` files & camera/AI/QR variables
Four files: `client\.env.example`, `server\.env.example`, `ai-service\.env.example`, `edge\securepi\.env.example`.

**`client\.env.example`** (all browser-exposed, `VITE_` prefixed):
- `VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-node-backend.example.com` (empty locally)
- `VITE_PI_CAMERA_STREAM_URL=http://your-pi-address:8081/video_feed`
- `VITE_PI_CAMERA_SNAPSHOT_URL=http://your-pi-address:8081/snapshot`
- `VITE_SECUREPI_STREAM_URL=http://<raspberry-pi-ip>:8001/video_feed`
- `VITE_SECUREPI_HEALTH_URL=http://<raspberry-pi-ip>:8001/health`
- `VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=your-recaptcha-site-key`

**`server\.env.example`** (AI / gate / edge):
- `FACE_AI_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8501` (InsightFace base; backend appends `/api/encode-faces`, `/user/recognize`, `/refresh`)
- `PYTHON_AI_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/recognize` (full endpoint, teammate incident-scan route)
- `AI_SERVICE_KEY=your-shared-ai-service-secret` (sent as `X-AI-Service-Key` to FastAPI; must match ai-service)
- `EDGE_SERVICE_TOKEN=...` (`x-edge-token` for a Pi edge node), `EDGE_INGEST_TOKEN=dev-securepi-token` (Bearer for `POST /api/edge/detection-alerts`)
- `GATE_EARLY_MINUTES=30`, `GATE_LATE_MINUTES=60` (loading-bay arrival grace window)
- `WHATSAPP_ENABLED=false` + `WHATSAPP_API_URL/ACCESS_TOKEN/API_KEY/PHONE_NUMBER_ID`
- reCAPTCHA secret, SMTP/mail, DB creds, `FRONTEND_URL`/`CLIENT_URL`/`ALLOWED_ORIGINS`.

**`ai-service\.env.example`**:
- `AI_SERVICE_KEY=your-shared-ai-service-secret` (both directions; must match server)
- `ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173`
- DB creds (reads same Postgres as backend for embeddings).

