### Bottom line for adding tests
Put new client tests in `client\tests\Tan Xiu Li, Felicia\<Feature>.test.jsx`, import `{ vi, describe, test, expect, beforeEach, afterEach }` from `vitest` and RTL from `@testing-library/react`, reach source via `../../src/...`, mock `axios` (default object via `vi.hoisted`), stub `navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia` + `fetch`, and mock camera/QR/OCR **at the `utils/gateCamera` and `utils/plateOcr` boundary** (never `@zxing/browser`/`tesseract.js` directly). Number your test titles, stub `Sidebar`, and set `localStorage` `accessToken`/`userRole`. No global setup file — add `import "@testing-library/jest-dom";` per-file only if you use those matchers.
